New Filters Tool Panel, Cell Editor Validation, Batch Editing, Date Picker Time Support, Tree Data Row Dragging.

## What's New

AG Grid {% migrationVersion() %} adds important new features – [New Filters Tool Panel](./tool-panel-filters-new/), [Cell Editor Validation](./cell-editing-validation/), [Batch Editing](./cell-editing-batch/), [Date Picker Time Support](./cell-data-types/#datetime), [Tree Data Row Dragging](./tree-data-row-dragging/), as described in the [release post](https://www.ag-grid.com/blog/whats-new-in-ag-grid-34/).

These improvements involve no breaking changes as listed below.

